      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشْيِيطٌ</span></b>  <i>Flesh-meat roasted,</i> (K,) or <i>made good,
and roasted,</i> (TA,) <i>for a company of men:</i> (K:)
